Modifications were made starting 2026-11-09, from upstream commit 8f226db
(MeshCore Hardened 0.10.15). They include the new name and application id,
the user interface rework, translations, the home-screen widget, the map
engine, ping/trace and radio statistics. The full history of changes is in
this repository's git log; CHANGELOG.md summarises each release, and
docs/upstream/ keeps upstream's own README and changelog up to the fork.

MeshCore Hardened reused code from reticulum-mobile-app
(https://github.com/thatSFguy/reticulum-mobile-app, AGPL-3.0) by the same
author. It implements the MeshCore protocol (https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore, MIT).

